Initial Value [Variable]
To reset a value, which the Variable recorded during a simulation run to an initial value, select this check
box.
Remarks
Plant Simulation sets the value during the reset phase and resets it in the init phase of the next simulation
run.
Initial Value - text box
After you select the check box, the Variable shows a text box.
Type the initial value for the next simulation run into the text box.
Note
The Data Types table, list, stack, queue, and randtime do not provide this feature.
