Integer Places [text box] - Variable
Type in the number of Integer Places which the Variable shows.
Remarks
The Variable can show up to 15 integer places. The default setting -1 means that Plant Simulation applies
no minimum to the number of integer places.
Type in a positive value to fill up the space before the decimal point with blank spaces until the specified
number of places has been reached when the Variable is shown in 3D.
Integer places Looks like this
-1
8
Note
This setting only applies to the Data Type [user-defined attribute] > real, length, weight, time, speed,
and acceleration.
