Decimal Places [text box] - Variable
Type in the number of Decimal Places which the object Variable shows. It can show up to 15 decimal
places.
Remarks
The default setting -1 shows all existing places.
Type in a positive value to show the number of decimal places, which you specified.
Integer places Looks like this
-1
8
Note
This setting only applies to the Data Type [Variable] > real, length, money, weight, time, speed, and
acceleration.
The number of decimal places for the data type time affects values differently than for the data type real.
The value -1 for the data type time means that the default time display format is displayed with four
decimal places.
A positive value means that Plant Simulation shows the number of decimal places that you typed in at
most.
