Tab Statistics
Tab Statistics [Variable]
The tab Statistics provides the settings listed in the table of contents to the left.
The tab shows the top five frequencies and the top five durations on the tab itself. Only Variables of Data
type string or integer records statistics values.
Tab Statistics
Plant Simulation Help 11-3781
Unpublished work. © 2026 Siemens

Active [check box] - statistics, Variable
To collect statistics data during a simulation run and to show the Top 5 Frequencies and the Top 5
Durations on the tab, select this check box. To not collect statistics, leave it cleared.
Remarks
Only Variables of Data type string or integer record statistics values.
The Variable only gathers statistics values if they exist for a time span greater than zero.
Suppose we have a Variable of type integer with an Initial Value of 0 and the following SimTalk sequence:
Variable = 1
wait 1
Variable = 2
wait 1
Variable = 1
Variable = 3
wait 1
For these settings the Frequency of 1, 2, and 3 is 1 each, as for the second assignment of 1, the value was
only present for a time span of 0.
The Initial Value of 0 is not recorded as well, as it was only present for a time span of 0.
The Durations of 1, 2, and 3 thus are 33.33% each.
SimTalk
StatisticsActive [SimTalk] - Variable
Active [check box] - statistics, Variable
